## Model card

- **Name:** Gemini 3.8 Live
- **Short description:** Google's realtime conversational audio/video model of the Gemini 3.8 Audio family (based on Gemini 3 Pro), with optional Live Avatar output and a Live Extended Thinking sibling. Model card published September 15, 2026.
- **Provider / access:** Gemini API, Gemini App, Google AI Studio, Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform, Google Search Live (official model card, Distribution section).
- **Release / knowledge:** Model card published 2026-09-15; knowledge cutoff January 2025 (card).
- **IDs:** `google/gemini-3.8-live` (no Free-tier ID verified on OpenCode Zen).
- **Context window:** up to 128K tokens input; 64K token audio/text output (24K with Live Avatar) (official card).
- **Modalities:** audio/image/video/text in; audio+text out (+video avatar with Live Avatar); realtime streaming; tool calls per family.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-24):** no verified public per-token price found (audio-session pricing page not located).
- **Architecture:** based on Gemini 3 Pro; proprietary.

